# Guard 2.x | Scope: AWS::Organizations::Account | Params: managementAccountId
# Description: Member accounts must not sit directly under the organization root, where they miss every OU-level policy.
# Member accounts directly under the root bypass all OU-level guardrails.
rule account_not_at_root when
    resourceType == "AWS::Organizations::Account"
    configuration.AccountId != CONFIG_RULE_PARAMETERS.managementAccountId {
    configuration.ParentIds[*] != /^r-/
        <<Member account sits directly under the organization root>>
}
